  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo>&#8734;</mo></msubsup></math> be a sequence such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.</p><p>Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>25</mn></msub><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>23</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>25</mn></msub><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>22</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>23</mn></msub><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>24</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>22</mn></msub><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>24</mn></msub></math> is equal to</p>",
