  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p>And&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>:</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Now for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>.</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>.</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>n</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Now adding all above equation upto&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now replacing&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Now putting&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>25</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>24</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></math></p><p>Now putting&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>23</mn></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>23</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>22</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>23</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>22</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>25</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>24</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>23</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>22</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mn>24</mn></mfenced><mfenced><mn>22</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>528</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
